File: libtiff/tif_pixarlog.c
Line: 253
Function: horizontalAccumulate12
Bug type: out-of-bounds-write
CWE: CWE-787
Explanation: Same REPEAT(stride, ...) pattern as horizontalAccumulateF. With stride == 0, REPEAT executes once, n is not decreased, and the while (n > 0) loop becomes infinite, repeatedly incrementing/dereferencing wp/op (lines 258–260), resulting in out-of-bounds reads and writes.

